The JSON-LD schemas in this directory (comment.jsonld, commentmeta.jsonld,
paste.jsonld, pastemeta.jsonld, types.jsonld) are copied from PrivateBin
(https://github.com/PrivateBin/PrivateBin). The server rewrites their URLs and
the expiration options at runtime. They remain under the original license:

